            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146821,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es el nombre de la variable contador en este código?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Top scores:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rank = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; rank &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; rank++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(rank + \" /><text value=\"&quot;.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>rank</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Top scores:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>rank</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146822,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ensamblar el bucle for para imprimir en la consola los números del <code>1</code> al <code>4</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &gt; 5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &lt; 4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i &lt; 5</code> seguido de <code>console.log(i)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Enemy spawned!</code> tres veces</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Los números <code>1</code> al <code>3</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Los números <code>0</code> a <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Enemy spawned!</code> tres veces.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 146824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dentro de los paréntesis, incrementa la variable contador usando el operador <code>++</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"68\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level map:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" row = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt;= \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" row += \" /><text value=\"&quot;#&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(row);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i++</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 146825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es la variable de contador del bucle for?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Coins:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" line = \" /><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" line += i;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(line);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>label</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>line</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 146826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" timer = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; timer &gt;= \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; timer--) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(timer);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Los números contando desde <code>0</code> hasta <code>5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Los números contando hacia atrás desde <code>5</code> hasta <code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"true\">Los números contando hacia atrás desde <code>5</code> hasta <code>0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Los números contando hacia atrás desde <code>5</code> hasta <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 146827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Se ejecuta el código dentro del bucle?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hp = \" /><text value=\"-10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; hp &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; hp++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">No podemos saber si el código dentro del bucle se ejecuta</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">No, porque cuando el bucle comienza, el valor de la variable contador es menor que <code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">El código se ejecuta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">No, porque cuando el bucle comienza, el valor de la variable contador es menor que <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
